{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>A Project I worked on for 5-Years, and never truly managed to finish. (20+ hours of content)</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't expect to be blown-away...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It Probably has bugs,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's Not perfect,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But I love it very much. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/a0fd623acd54359fd863d109ed042c75.avif?t=1773034857\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Conquer your opponents</strong>. Steal their information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play up to 3v3 Fast-Paced, Turn-Based Combat. Unlocking new companions, Abilities, and Items, over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cook recipes using any random 2-4 Ingredients.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct and customize your Syndicates Base.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/553388c2e4d582e90096b8470f7cf457.avif?t=1773034857\" width=432 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Prologue</strong> Story Arc &amp; <strong>The Plains</strong> Story Arc.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over <strong>500</strong> Unique Cinematic Comic Panels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.poster.avif?t=1773034857\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.webm?t=1773034857\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/extras/b7ca048b4b5be0eb2010a2c5562a9524.mp4?t=1773034857\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is <strong>&quot;ManHunter&quot;</strong> the greatest game ever made?? <strong>FUCK NO!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But it's pretty nice! Give it a shot.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465850?t=1773034857","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3465850?t=1773034857","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/abe831352cba30102cdfae7e84de69724ea54946/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773034857","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3465850/abe831352cba30102cdfae7e84de69724ea54946/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773034857","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains Moderate Violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3535070,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>A Project I worked on for 5-Years, and never truly managed to finish. (20+ hours of content)</strong></i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't expect to be blown-away...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It Probably has bugs,</p><p class=\"bb_paragr